<p>You summon a Rime Wraith inside of you, an intangible creature, that haunts both foes and allies for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">10, 13, 15, 18, 20</acronym> turns.</p><p>Every turn the wraith will select a new target and jump to it.</p><p>When the wraith enters a creature they are covered in hoarfrost for 3 turns:</p><ul><li> if friendly: increases cold resistance by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">10%, 16%, 20%, 26%, 30%,</acronym> converts all damage done to cold and increases cold damage by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">12%, 18%, 22%, 26%, 30%.</acronym></li><li> if hostile: reduces cold resistance by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5%, 8%, 10%, 13%, 15%</acronym> and move <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">20%, 26%, 31%, 36%, 40%</acronym> slower</li></ul><p>When selecting a target the wraith prefers one that is not affected by hoarfrost if possible.</p><p></p>